Package: outputxl
Title: Institutional-Styled Excel Outputs for Survey Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("outputxl authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "outputxl@example.com")
Description: Produces professionally formatted Excel workbooks from data 
    analysis outputs, following institutional styling conventions used by 
    international development organizations and government agencies. Features 
    include branded color palettes for UN agencies (UNFPA, UNDP, UNICEF, 
    ECLAC), the World Bank, and neutral academic styles. Automatic TOTAL row 
    detection, alternating row shading, freeze panes, auto-width columns, 
    and a stacking system that lets you write multiple tables to a single 
    sheet with consistent spacing.
